OL,3,AUS bank services returning to normal
OL,4,Aafter major outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of customers at major US
OL,7,Fbanks, including JP Morgan Chase, Wells
OL,8,FFargo and Bank of America, reported
OL,9,Ftrouble accessing services, though
OL,10,FChase said its issue has now been
OL,11,Fresolved.
OL,13,FChase Bank - the largest banking
OL,14,Finstitution in the US - said a
OL,15,F"software bug" in its hardware systems
OL,16,Fwas behind the glitch and it was not a
OL,17,Fcyber security incident.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,119,105,200,300,0,100
