OL,3,AUS bank services returning to normal
OL,4,Aafter major outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said "this was not a
OL,7,Fsystemic issue" but noted the impact
OL,8,Fmay have affected other banks "only to
OL,9,Fthe extent that they were a party to a
OL,10,Ftransaction with us".
OL,12,FThe issue comes after a string of
OL,13,Funrelated technical problems, including
OL,14,Fa massive Microsoft outage and a
OL,15,Fnetwork failure that grounded all US
OL,16,Fflights.
